    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Downey McCarthy Auctioneers are pleased to present to the market this cosy two bedroom terraced property, which occupies a most convenient location close to all amenities in Wilton such as shopping centres, CUH, CUMH and restaurants, public transport, MTU, and UCC etc.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of reception hallway, open plan kitchen/dining/living area and main bathroom on the ground floor whilst upstairs the property offers two bedrooms."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "There is no private yard or garden, there is a communal garden space for residents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 2.5m x 1.05m \r\nA solid door allows access into the reception hallway. The reception hallway has tile flooring, access to a storage press that has plumbing for a washing machine, one centre light fitting, access to the electrical board, and one radiator. A door allows access into the bathroom.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.03m x 0.89m \r\nThe main bathroom has one frosted window overlooking the front of the property, a three piece suite with a built-in shower cubicle incorporating a power shower of the mains, fully tiled walls and floors, one radiator and one centre light fitting. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living - 4.71m x 3.83m \r\nThe open plan kitchen/dining/living area has one large window overlooking the front of the property, space for a couch and a dining table, access to under stair storage, an alcove containing an electric stove insert, and tile flooring. The kitchen features units at eye and floor level, worktop counter, space for an oven and a fridge, and a stainless steel sink. The kitchen allows access into under stair storage which is ideal for coats etc., and the hot water tank is also stored here.\r\n\r\nStairs and Landing - 2.22m x 1.91m \r\nStairs from the open plan kitchen/dining/living area allow access up to the first floor landing. There is carpet flooring throughout, one centre light fitting, and an access hatch to the attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.74m x 2.33m \r\nThis double bedroom one has one window overlooking the front of the property, one centre light fitting, one radiator, wardrobe units for storage, and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.58m x 1.94m \r\nThis single bedroom one has one window overlooking the side of the property, wardrobe units for storage, one centre light fitting, one radiator and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 45.6 Sq. M. / 491 Sq. Ft. \r\nBuilt in 1985\r\nBER F\r\nTwo bedrooms upstairs\r\nOff street parking - open spaces at the side of the house\r\n10 minutes walking distance to Cork University Hospital, and CUMH\r\n5 minutes walk to Wilton Shopping Centre\r\nLocated close to the South Ring road network, \r\nLocated on the bus route to Cork city centre\r\nThe property was rented out previously \r\nLast rent registered with the RTB at €1,057 - set in March 2026, landlord gave notice to the tenant"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Please see Eircode T12 HPK3 for directions."
      },
